#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/fop.xml:180
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of fop"
msgstr "Instalação do fop"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/fop.xml:183
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Ensure <envar>$JAVA_HOME</envar> is set correctly before beginning the "
"build. To build the <application>JIMI SDK</application> and/or "
"<application>XMLUnit</application> extension classes, ensure the "
"corresponding <filename class='extension'>.jar</filename> files can be found"
" via the <envar>CLASSPATH</envar> environment variable."
msgstr ""
"Certifique-se de que <envar>$JAVA_HOME</envar> esteja configurada "
"corretamente antes de iniciar a construção. Para construir as classes de "
"extensão <application>JIMI SDK</application> e (ou) "
"<application>XMLUnit</application>, certifique-se de que os arquivos "
"<filename class='extension'>.jar</filename> correspondentes possam ser "
"encontrados por intermédio da variável de ambiente <envar>CLASSPATH</envar>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/fop.xml:191
#, xml-text
msgid "Installing OFFO Hyphenation Patterns"
msgstr "Instalando Padrões de Hifenização OFFO"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/fop.xml:194
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Copy the XML hyphenation patterns into the fop source tree by running the "
"following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Copie os padrões de hifenização XML para a árvore do fonte do fop executando"
" os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/fop.xml:198
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>unzip ../offo-hyphenation.zip &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp offo-hyphenation/hyph/* fop/hyph &amp;&amp;\n"
"rm -rf offo-hyphenation</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>unzip ../offo-hyphenation.zip &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp offo-hyphenation/hyph/* fop/hyph &amp;&amp;\n"
"rm -rf offo-hyphenation</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/fop.xml:205
#, xml-text
msgid "Installing a temporary Maven binary"
msgstr "Instalando um binário temporário Maven"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/fop.xml:208
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Starting with fop-2.5, the Maven build system is required. We use the binary"
" provided by apache, that we install in a temporary location:"
msgstr ""
"A partir do fop-2.5, o sistema de construção Maven é exigido. Nós usamos o "
"binário fornecido pelo Apache, que instalamos em um local temporário:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/fop.xml:212
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>tar -xf ../apache-maven-&maven-version;-bin.tar.gz -C "
"/tmp</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>tar -xf ../apache-maven-&maven-version;-bin.tar.gz -C "
"/tmp</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/fop.xml:217
#, xml-text
msgid "Installing fop Components"
msgstr "Instalando Componentes fop"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/fop.xml:228
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <command>javadoc</command> command that ships with OpenJDK 10 and later "
"has become much stricter than previous versions regarding conformance of the"
" Javadoc comments in source code to HTML. The FOP documentation does not "
"meet those standards, so the conformance checks have to be disabled. This "
"can be done with the following command:"
msgstr ""
"O comando <command>javadoc</command> fornecido com o OpenJDK 10 e posterior "
"tornou-se muito mais rigoroso que as versões anteriores em relação à "
"conformidade dos comentários Javadoc no código-fonte para HTML. A "
"documentação do FOP não atende a esses padrões, de forma que as verificações"
" de conformidade tem de ser desabilitadas. Isso pode ser feito com o "
"seguinte comando:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/fop.xml:236
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -i '\\@&lt;/javad@i\\\n"
"&lt;arg value=\"-Xdoclint:none\"/&gt;\\\n"
"&lt;arg value=\"--allow-script-in-comments\"/&gt;\\\n"
"&lt;arg value=\"--ignore-source-errors\"/&gt;' \\\n"
"    fop/build.xml</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -i '\\@&lt;/javad@i\\\n"
"&lt;arg value=\"-Xdoclint:none\"/&gt;\\\n"
"&lt;arg value=\"--allow-script-in-comments\"/&gt;\\\n"
"&lt;arg value=\"--ignore-source-errors\"/&gt;' \\\n"
"    fop/build.xml</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/fop.xml:252
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Compile <application>fop</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Compile o <application>fop</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/fop.xml:256
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cd fop &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"LC_ALL=en_US.UTF-8                     \\\n"
"PATH=$PATH:/tmp/apache-maven-&maven-version;/bin \\\n"
"ant package javadocs &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"mv build/javadocs .</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cd fop &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"LC_ALL=en_US.UTF-8                     \\\n"
"PATH=$PATH:/tmp/apache-maven-&maven-version;/bin \\\n"
"ant package javadocs &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"mv build/javadocs .</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/fop.xml:265
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This package comes with a test suite, but the java infrastructure installed "
"in this book does not allow running it."
msgstr ""
"Esse pacote vem com uma suíte de teste, mas a infraestrutura java instalada "
"neste livro não permite executá-la."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/fop.xml:270
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Now, install <application>Fop</application> as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, instale o <application>Fop</application> como o(a) usuário(a) "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/fop.xml:274
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -d -m755 -o root -g root          /opt/fop-&fop-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -vR build conf examples fop* javadocs lib /opt/fop-&fop-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"chmod a+x /opt/fop-&fop-version;/fop                                &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -v -sfn fop-&fop-version; /opt/fop</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -d -m755 -o root -g root          /opt/fop-&fop-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -vR build conf examples fop* javadocs lib /opt/fop-&fop-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"chmod a+x /opt/fop-&fop-version;/fop                                &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -v -sfn fop-&fop-version; /opt/fop</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/fop.xml:280
#, xml-text
msgid "Finally, remove the temporary copy of Apache Maven:"
msgstr "Por fim, remova a cópia temporária do Apache Maven:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/fop.xml:283
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>rm -rf /tmp/apache-maven-&maven-version;</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>rm -rf /tmp/apache-maven-&maven-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/fop.xml:290
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/fop.xml:293
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>sed -i ... build.xml</command>: This adds three switches to the "
"<command>javadoc</command> command, preventing some errors from occurring "
"when building the documentation."
msgstr ""
"<command>sed -i ... build.xml</command>: Isso adiciona três chaves ao "
"comando <command>javadoc</command>, evitando que alguns erros ocorram "
"durante a construção da documentação."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/fop.xml:299
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>export LC_ALL=en_US.UTF-8</command>: the compiler fails if using an"
" ASCII locale."
msgstr ""
"<command>export LC_ALL=en_US.UTF-8</command>: o compilador falha se usar uma"
" localidade ASCII."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/fop.xml:304
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>ant <option>target</option></command>: This reads the file "
"<filename>build.xml</filename> and builds the target: <option>compile "
"</option> compiles the java sources, <option>jar-main</option> generates jar"
" archives, <option>jar-hyphenation</option> generates the hyphenation "
"patterns for FOP, <option>junit</option> runs the "
"<application>junit</application> tests, and <option>javadocs</option> builds"
" the documentation. The <option>all</option> target runs all of the above."
msgstr ""
"<command>ant <option>target</option></command>: Isso lê o arquivo "
"<filename>build.xml</filename> e constrói o alvo: <option>compile </option> "
"compila os fontes java; <option>jar-main</option> gera arquivos jar; "
"<option>jar-hyphenation</option> gera os padrões de hifenização para o FOP; "
"<option>junit</option> executa os testes <application>junit</application>; e"
" <option>javadocs</option> constrói a documentação. O alvo "
"<option>all</option> executa tudo do acima."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/fop.xml:315
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>ln -v -sf fop-&fop-version; /opt/fop</command>: This is optional "
"and creates a convenience symlink so that <envar>$FOP_HOME</envar> doesn't "
"have to be changed each time there's a package version change."
msgstr ""
"<command>ln -v -sf fop-&fop-version; /opt/fop</command>: Isso é opcional e "
"cria um link simbólico de conveniência, de forma que "
"<envar>$FOP_HOME</envar> não tenha que ser mudada cada vez que exista uma "
"mudança na versão do pacote."

